 000F  5B			    POP BX 
 0010  58			    POP AX 
 0011				GET_DAYS_RET: 
 0011  CB			    RET 
 0012				GET_DAYS ENDP 
				 
				; Stack parameters: caller pushes month, then y
				ear. 
				; After PUSH BP: [BP+2] return IP, [BP+4] retur
				n CS, 
				; [BP+6] year, [BP+8] month. Return weekday in 
				AX (Sunday=0). 
 0012				FIRST_DAY PROC FAR 
